65926118791/azo-20260829x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"AutoZone, Inc. (\"AutoZone,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"our\" or \"us\") is a leading retailer and distributor of automotive replacement parts and accessories in the Americas. We began operations in 1979 and at August 29, 2026, operated 6,863 stores in the United States (\"U.S.\"), 1,001 stores in Mexico and 167 stores in Brazil. Each store carries an extensive product line for cars, sport utility vehicles, vans and light duty trucks, including new and remanufactured automotive hard parts, maintenance items, accessories and non-automotive products. At August 29, 2026, in 6,443 of our domestic stores as well as the vast majority of our stores in Mexico and Brazil, we had a commercial sales program that provides prompt delivery of parts and other products and commercial credit to local, regional and national repair garages, dealers, service stations, fleet owners and other accounts. We also sell auto","zh":"AutoZone, Inc.（「AutoZone」、「本公司」、「我們」、「我們的」）是美洲領先的汽車更換零件和配件零售商和分銷商。我們於 1979 年開始運營，截至 2026 年 8 月 29 日，在美國（「美國」）經營 6,863 家商店，在墨西哥經營 1,001 家商店，在巴西經營 167 家商店。每家商店都擁有廣泛的汽車、運動型多用途車、貨車和輕型卡車產品線，包括新的和再製造的汽車硬零件、維修用品、配件和非汽車產品。截至 2026 年 8 月 29 日，我們在 6,443 家國內商店以及墨西哥和巴西的絕大多數商店中實施了商業銷售計劃，為當地、地區和國家修理廠、經銷商、服務站、車隊所有者和其他帳戶提供及時交付零件和其他產品以及商業信貸。我們也賣汽車"},{"en":"We believe the foundation of our success is our culture, which is deeply rooted in our Pledge and Values: Puts Customers First, Cares About People, Strives for Exceptional Performance, Energizes Others, Embraces Diversity and Helps Teams Succeed. Our Pledge and Values define how our employees (\"AutoZoners\") take care of customers and fellow AutoZoners by fostering a strong, unique culture of teamwork and customer service. Each AutoZoner works hard to Live the Pledge, remain committed to our values, share their passion for WOW! Customer Service and Go the Extra Mile every day to continue building and growing AutoZone for our customers.","zh":"我們相信，我們成功的基礎是我們的文化，它深植於我們的承諾和價值觀：客戶至上、關心員工、追求卓越績效、激勵他人、擁抱多元化並幫助團隊取得成功。我們的承諾和價值觀定義了我們的員工（「AutoZoners」）如何透過培養強大、獨特的團隊合作和客戶服務文化來照顧客戶和其他 AutoZoners。每個 AutoZone 人都努力實踐承諾，堅持我們的價值觀，分享他們對 WOW 的熱情！客戶服務並每天加倍努力，繼續為我們的客戶建立和發展 AutoZone。"},{"en":"We seek to be the employer of choice as we compete for talent in our retail stores, field supervision, distribution centers, and store support functions. We focus heavily on retention by offering competitive compensation and benefits packages, extensive training and development opportunities.","zh":"在爭取零售店、現場監督、配送中心和商店支援職能領域的人才時，我們力求成為首選雇主。我們透過提供有競爭力的薪資和福利、廣泛的培訓和發展機會，高度重視留住人才。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The sale of automotive parts, accessories and maintenance items is highly competitive. AutoZone competes on the basis of customer service, including the knowledge and expertise of our AutoZoners and our ability to provide prompt delivery to commercial customers; merchandise quality, selection and availability; product warranty; store layouts, location and convenience; price; and the strength of our AutoZone brand name and quality, trademarks and service marks.","zh":"汽車零件、配件和維修用品的銷售競爭非常激烈。 AutoZone 以客戶服務為基礎進行競爭，包括 AutoZone 人員的知識和專業知識以及我們為商業客戶提供及時交付的能力；商品品質、選擇和可用性；產品保固；商店佈局、位置和便利性；價格;以及我們 AutoZone 品牌名稱和品質、商標和服務標誌的實力。"},{"en":"Our competitors include national, regional and local auto parts chains, independently owned parts stores, online automotive parts stores or marketplaces, wholesale distributors, jobbers, repair shops, car washes and auto dealers, in addition to discount and mass merchandise stores, hardware stores, supermarkets, drugstores, convenience stores, home stores and other retailers that sell aftermarket vehicle parts and supplies, chemicals, accessories and tools.","zh":"我們的競爭對手包括國家、地區和當地的汽車零件連鎖店、獨立擁有的零件商店、線上汽車零件商店或市場、批發分銷商、批發商、維修店、洗車店和汽車經銷商，以及折扣和大眾商品商店、五金店、超市、藥店、便利商店、家居店和其他銷售後汽車零件和用品、化學品、零件和工具。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2026-08-29","items":[{"name":"US","val":17613832000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":2724723000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":20338555000}},"peers":["ORLY","AAP","ROST","DLTR","KMX"]}}